# Flux never reads these: they are run by hand (Ansible from the Mac) or are
# render input, not Kubernetes objects. Same idea as ../edge/.sourceignore.
#   ./k3s                inventory, vars and runbook for the k3s install
#   inventory, tools.yaml, edge.yaml   base OS / tools / kiosk runs
#   ./cluster-apps.yaml  input of blueprints render-cluster-apps (ClusterApps)
# kustomization.yaml (generated) lists only the Flux objects; this keeps it
# that way even if that file goes.
k3s/
inventory
tools.yaml
edge.yaml
cluster-apps.yaml
*.md
kiosk.yaml
